      "Logo artwork contains zero typography or wordmark.",
      "Upper hemisphere depicts a 4-window minibus, two palm trees, and faceted mountains in #ED7C30 and #F2A15F.",
      "Lower hemisphere depicts a top-down 2-blade kayak and soft wave shadow in #4394D5, #3171AE, and #387DB4 (JPEG only).",
      "Diagonal ascending aircraft streak overhangs both left and right disc edges; bottom blue edge measures 17.12 deg.",
      "assets/brand/logo-mark.svg uses evenodd transparent cutouts with no white backing fill, causing dark backgrounds to bleed into the aircraft, bus, palms, and kayak.",
      "Photography exists in assets/img/ for Meghalaya, Dawki, and Nepal; no Kashmir photo is supplied."
    ],
    "proposedDecisionsRequiringApproval": [
      "Derived logo variants not yet in assets/brand/: white-backed reverse SVG, disc-only avatar, monochrome single-ink SVG, horizontal lockup, stacked lockup.",
      "Derived 50-950 color ramps, blue-tinted slate neutrals (#111823 darkest ink), Night Ocean (#132436) dark mode, and contrast-adjusted text tokens (#A45826, #316896, #25517B).",
      "Reconciliation of literal logo mountain highlight #F2A15F vs UI ramp step orange-400 #F2A16A.",
      "Typography pairing: Plus Jakarta Sans (display/wordmark), Inter (body/UI/tabular-nums), Hind Siliguri (Bangla), optional JetBrains Mono (admin IDs).",
      "Type floors: 17px Bangla running text minimum, 13px Latin UI minimum.",
      "17-degree Flight Angle layout geometry (tan 17 deg = 0.3057) for marketing, banned inside dense admin tables and forms.",
      "Dual-mode layout specifications separating airy marketing pages from high-density admin interfaces."
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Primary audience demographics (Bangladeshi adults 22-45, Chattogram/Dhaka, Android mobile-first) inferred from Facebook posts and BDT pricing.",
      "Corporate/institutional custom group tours and standalone air ticketing/visa assistance inferred as secondary service pillars.",
      "Dense back-office admin UI needs (booking ledger, bank deposit reconciliation, seat caps, visa queue) inferred from manual bank-deposit confirmation workflow in plan.md."
    ]
